# Privacy Policy

Last updated: 1 November 2026

This application is a personal tool used by a single individual to connect their own Google Calendar to their own Home Assistant installation.

**Data accessed:** Calendar events from the owner's Google account.

**How data is used:** Only to display and automate events within the owner's private Home Assistant instance.

**Data sharing:** No data is sold, shared with, or disclosed to any third party.

**Data storage:** Authentication tokens are stored only on the owner's own Home Assistant server. No data is stored elsewhere.

**Contact:** your-email@example.com
